CYD//RECON includes data and register sequences derived from the following works:

* Flock Safety / Raven / SoundThinking detection heuristics (SSID keywords,
  BLE names, BLE company ID, MAC prefixes, Raven service UUIDs) adapted from
  flock-you-esp32 - https://github.com/simeononsecurity/flock-you-esp32
  Licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Those heuristics in turn credit
  colonelpanichacks/flock-you, wgreenberg/flock-you, GainSec, @NitekryDPaul
  and DeFlock contributors.

* ES8311 codec bring-up sequence follows Espressif's es8311 component
  (Copyright Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD, Apache License 2.0),
  reimplemented on top of Arduino Wire.

* ST77922 panel initialisation register values and the FNK0104N pin map come
  from Freenove's board support files for the FNK0104N
  (https://github.com/Freenove/Freenove_ESP32_S3_Display). The driver code in
  src/display.cpp is an independent implementation.
